<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apogee Enterprises started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apogee Enterprises started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it started coverage of Apogee Enterprises Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-18 month price target of $50 per share, which is 18.5 times calendar 1998 earnings estimate of $2.70 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7/8 to 37-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
